Description:

A free/busy scheduling request posted to a CalDAV schedule Outbox now reports
the correct organizer address in every reply, no matter how many attendees
the request carries.  Previously a request with several thousand attendees
could cause the organizer address in the reply for each local attendee to be
replaced by unrelated bytes from the server process's memory.


